| DiscIcon: HardDisc4 as a hard disc icon on the icon bar
| (and NetWatch: RISC OS's name servers follow Linux's network; Battery:
| the battery's icon, on a machine with one)
|
| Copyright (c) 2026 Andrew Youll. MIT licence (see LICENSE).
| (Filer_Run keeps its name as given and starts the task later, by when
| Obey$Dir may be another file's (SparkFS's AutoRun at start-up: "File
| ...!SparkFS.AutoRun.^.!NetWatch.!Run not found"): DiscIcon$Dir holds.)
Set DiscIcon$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IfThere <DiscIcon$Dir>.^.!NetWatch Then Filer_Run <DiscIcon$Dir>.^.!NetWatch
IfThere <DiscIcon$Dir>.^.!Battery Then Filer_Run <DiscIcon$Dir>.^.!Battery
WimpSlot -min 64k -max 64k
BASIC -quit <Obey$Dir>.!RunImage
